{
    "title": "Fuel Forward",
    "description": "The Fuel Forward\u2122 App is your mobile sidekick at Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae stations nationwide.  \r\n\r\nDownload the app today for an easy way to pay and save on fuel. No need to take out your wallet. Simply create an account in the app, add your favorite payment method, and enjoy the benefits to keep you going forward!  \r\n\r\nThe Fuel Forward\u2122 App allows you to: \r\n-Enjoy convenient mobile payments right from your driver\u2019s seat \r\n-Save on fuel and get access to special promotions  \r\n-Make safe, secure transactions from the mobile wallet at the pump and inside the store  \r\n-Find and get directions to Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae stations \r\n-Discover fuel prices near you and view station amenities  \r\n-View transaction history and mobile receipts  \r\n-Earn and track KickBack\u00ae loyalty program points at participating locations \r\n\r\nAccepted Payment Methods:  \r\nVisa, Mastercard, Discover, American Express, PayPal, Venmo, Click to Pay, Google Pay, Samsung Pay, Direct Pay (link to your checking account), Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae credit cards and Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae gift cards.  \r\n\r\nApply for a Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae or 76\u00ae credit card directly through the app.* \r\n\r\nSet up your mobile wallet: \r\n1. Create and login to your account \r\n2. Select Wallet on the menu bar \r\n3. Tap the Add button\r\n4. Add your favorite payment method and start saving on fuel! \r\n\r\nPay with your phone: \r\n1. Open the app when you\u2019re at the station \r\n2. Select Pay button \r\n3. Enter your pump number and select Authorize \r\n4. Fill up your vehicle and you\u2019re ready to keep going forward! Your receipt will display automatically in the app.  \r\n\r\nBy downloading this app, you agree to receive offers, discounts, and other benefits specifically designed for app users.\u202f If you change your mind and do not wish to receive the offers, you may delete the app at any time.\r\n\r\n* Subject to credit approval. Terms and conditions apply.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Fuel Forward\u2122 App is your mobile sidekick at Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae stations nationwide.  <br><br>Download the app today for an easy way to pay and save on fuel. No need to take out your wallet. Simply create an account in the app, add your favorite payment method, and enjoy the benefits to keep you going forward!  <br><br>The Fuel Forward\u2122 App allows you to: <br>-Enjoy convenient mobile payments right from your driver\u2019s seat <br>-Save on fuel and get access to special promotions  <br>-Make safe, secure transactions from the mobile wallet at the pump and inside the store  <br>-Find and get directions to Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae stations <br>-Discover fuel prices near you and view station amenities  <br>-View transaction history and mobile receipts  <br>-Earn and track KickBack\u00ae loyalty program points at participating locations <br><br>Accepted Payment Methods:  <br>Visa, Mastercard, Discover, American Express, PayPal, Venmo, Click to Pay, Google Pay, Samsung Pay, Direct Pay (link to your checking account), Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae credit cards and Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae and 76\u00ae gift cards.  <br><br>Apply for a Phillips 66\u00ae, Conoco\u00ae or 76\u00ae credit card directly through the app.* <br><br>Set up your mobile wallet: <br>1. Create and login to your account <br>2. Select Wallet on the menu bar <br>3. Tap the Add button<br>4. Add your favorite payment method and start saving on fuel! <br><br>Pay with your phone: <br>1. Open the app when you\u2019re at the station <br>2. Select Pay button <br>3. Enter your pump number and select Authorize <br>4. Fill up your vehicle and you\u2019re ready to keep going forward! Your receipt will display automatically in the app.  <br><br>By downloading this app, you agree to receive offers, discounts, and other benefits specifically designed for app users.\u202f If you change your mind and do not wish to receive the offers, you may delete the app at any time.<br><br>* Subject to credit approval. Terms and conditions apply.",
